'''Gato Amigo''' (ネコアミーゴ, ''Neko Amīgo'', '''Cat Amigo''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Gato Amigo
|image = E 139.png
|first appearance = [[Boogie Up (Expert)]]
|latest appearance = [[Infernal Tower/Floor 20|Infernal Tower - Floor 20]]
|money drop = 200¢ - 790¢
}}

==Enemy==
Gato Amigo has the lowest health of all Awakened enemies along with slow movement speed, but he has very strong non-stop attacks that have a 50% chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] Cat Units in his range.

